ron</A></span><br> <span class=usertitle>Deus Factum</span><br> <font color=#000000>(9/11/01 12:17:51 pm)</font><br>   <a href=http://pub14.ezboard.com/fdeusfactumgeneral.showAddReplyScreenFromWeb?topicID=403.topic&index=2>Reply</a>   </td><td valign=top align=left class=m><span class=title> Re: Hope your all safe</span><hr size=1> Hi All,<br><br>All safe here (West Coaster) and my family in NY made it out okay.  If you can, consider donating blood, blankets, and non-perishable foods.  They're going to need them.  Your local Red Cross will probably have some good details.  My thoughts go out to all of you who are affected.<br><br>Dan <p></p><i></i></td></tr><tr bgcolor=#999999><td nowrap width=20% valign=top align=left><span class=title> <A HREF=http://pub14.ezboard.com/uusalrahl.showPublicProfile?language=EN>Usal Rahl</A></span><br> <span class=usertitle>DF Guest</span><br> <font color=#000000>(9/11/01 1:03:02 pm)</font><br>   <a href=http://pub14.ezboard.com/fdeusfactumgeneral.showAddReplyScreenFromWeb?topicID=403.topic&index=3>Reply</a>   </td><td valign=top align=left class=m><span class=title> Re: Hope your all safe</span><hr size=1> I've a appointment to give blood for the relief tomarrow morning actually. NY is just a hour north of me and this hit hard. Add Washington DC 3 hours south... <br><br> <p><hr width="100%"><br><center><b><font face="Abadi MT Condensed"><font size=+2><u><i>Usal Rahl</u></i></a></font></font></font></b><br><font face="Trebuchet MS">58th Season Outrider</font><br><i><font size=-1>"If you are not confused, then you don’t truly know what is going on."</font></i></center><br></p><i></i></td></tr><tr bgcolor=#aaaaaa><td nowrap width=20% valign=top align=left><span class=title> <A HREF=http://pub14.ezboard.com/usanleea.showPublicProfile?language=EN>sanleea</A></span><br> <span class=usertitle>Deus Factum</span><br> <font color=#000000>(9/11/01 2:50:02 pm)</font><br>   <a href=http://pub14.ezboard.com/fdeusfactumgeneral.showAddReplyScreenFromWeb?topicID=403.topic&index=4>Reply</a>   </td><td valign=top align=left class=m><span class=title> Re: Hope your all safe</span><hr size=1> I am hoping that all is well with everyone and their family/friends.  This is a terrible event.  NYC and Washington are less than 2 and 3 hours away from where I live.  I will keep those affected by this tragedy in my thoughts.<br>  <p></p><i>Edited by: <A HREF=http://pub14.ezboard.com/usanleea.showPublicProfile?language=EN>sanleea</A> at: 9/11/01 2:54:16 pm<br></i></td></tr><tr bgcolor=#999999><td nowrap width=20% valign=top align=left><span class=title> <A HREF=http://pub14.ezboard.com/ugadortanakin.showPublicProfile?language=EN>Gador Tanakin</A></span><br> <span class=usertitle>Deus Factum</span><br> <font color=#000000>(9/11/01 3:23:55 pm)</font><br>   <a href=http://pub14.ezboard.com/fdeusfactumgeneral.showAddReplyScreenFromWeb?topicID=403.topic&index=5>Reply</a>   </td><td valign=top align=left class=m><span class=title> Re: Hope your all safe</span><hr size=1> Living less than a half hour from downtown Chicago, this morning scared the living crap out of me.  I'm not usually the religious type, I'm asking us all to take a moment and offer up a prayer for all those that have been injured or killed in New York and Washington.<br><br>My god bless you and yours.<br><br>Ray <p></p><i></i></td></tr><tr bgcolor=#aaaaaa><td nowrap width=20% valign=top align=left><span class=title> <A HREF=http://pub14.ezboard.com/ufalanofzeb.showPublicProfile?language=EN>Falan of Zeb</A></span><br> <span class=usertitle>DF Guest</span><br> <font color=#000000>(9/11/01 7:04:22 pm)</font><br>   <a href=http://pub14.ezboard.com/fdeusfactumgeneral.showAddReplyScreenFromWeb?topicID=403.topic&index=6>Reply</a>   </td><td valign=top align=left class=m><span class=title> Re: Hope your all safe</span><hr size=1> A chill went down my spine.  An old office of mine was 5th floor; e ring; west helipad side; but facing inside rings, not an outside view.  That office is now in the middle of the hole in the pentagon.  It was a long time ago; I hope those I knew have since moved on or retired.  Army &amp; Air Force Civilian Welfare Fund; I hope you retired to your grandkids George, <p></p><i></i></td></tr><tr bgcolor=#999999><td nowrap width=20% valign=top align=left><span class=title> <A HREF=http://pub14.ezboard.com/usanenu.showPublicProfile?language=EN>Sanenu</A>&nbsp; <IMG HEIGHT=10 WIDTH=10 SRC="http://www.ezboard.com/ezgfx/globalBlack.gif" BORDER=0></span><br> <span class=usertitle>Deus Factum</span><br> <font color=#000000>(9/11/01 7:24:52 pm)</font><br>   <a href=http://pub14.ezboard.com/fdeusfactumgeneral.showAddReplyScreenFromWeb?topicID=403.topic&index=7>Reply</a>   </td><td valign=top align=left class=m><span class=title> Re: Hope your all safe</span><hr size=1> I hope so too Falan.  <br><br>For anyone trying to get in touch with friends and family in New York, I have been having more success with email rather then the phone. <p></p><i></i></td></tr><tr bgcolor=#aaaaaa><td nowrap width=20% valign=top align=left><span class=title> <A HREF=http://pub14.ezboard.com/uobillo.showPublicProfile?language=EN>obillo</A></span><br> <span class=usertitle>DF Guest</span><br> <font color=#000000>(9/12/01 6:07:31 am)</font><br>   <a href=http://pub14.ezboard.com/fdeusfactumgeneral.showAddReplyScreenFromWeb?topicID=403.topic&index=8>Reply</a>   </td><td valign=top align=left class=m><span class=title> Re: Hope your all safe</span><hr size=1> Hi All,<br>To USA friends i said this:I am deeply sorry for what has happend to your families and friends and hope all are ok.<br>I know how you feel i live in Toronto Canada a few hundred miles from New York and it was scarey today as i have family and friends right there in New York and some how today none were hurt. Still in a little shock that none were hurt but i know others were not so luck and those my heart goes out to you all<!--EZCODE EMOTICON START :( --><img src=http://www.ezboard.com/intl/aenglish/images/emoticons/frown.gif ALT=":("><!--EZCODE EMOTICON END--> <br><br> <p></p><i></i></td></tr><tr bgcolor=#999999><td nowrap width=20% valign=top align=left><span class=title> <A HREF=http://pub14.ezboard.com/ufaldaar.showPublicProfile?language=EN>Faldaar</A></span><br> <span class=usertitle>Deus Factum</span><br> <font color=#000000>(9/12/01 3:56:18 pm)</font><br>   <a href=http://pub14.ezboard.com/fdeusfactumgeneral.showAddReplyScreenFromWeb?topicID=403.topic&index=9>Reply</a>   </td><td valign=top align=left class=m><span class=title> Re: Hope your all safe</span><hr size=1> I living in Washington DC, and although I work from home at the moment, my office is in downtown about 2 blocks from the Capitol. I also happend to be in the office for meetings that day.<br><br>I can tell you it was pretty nerve wracking, at first I didnt really think about what was going on, then someone reminded to me that I was in a governtment building and they just flew a plane into the Pentagon.<br><br>Our building, along with all the other government buildings nearby (DOT, FAA, NASA, NTSB etc) were evacuated.  The streets were clogged, so I started to walk home to my apartment in the northwest of dc near American University, about 10 miles from the Capitol.  As I cross the Mall and passed near the Monument I could see the thick smoke from the pentagon, emergency vehicles, heavily armed police were everywhere.  They blocked a number of streets around the White House. <br><br>F16's flying cover, pentagon burning, heavily armed police, I thought it was the start of WW3.  But that never really dawned on me until I go to my girlfriends place in downtown and sat and watched what was going on.  The TV held me like deer in headlights, I had seen it before when I was at work, but somehow the walk had given it time to all sink in, and I really started to question why I moved from peaceful Halifax Nova Scotia to the target point of every terrorist and Soviet Nuke in the world, Washington DC.<br><br>Then I finally said...&quot;F*ck it, if I am gonna go I am gonna go, regardless of where I am&quot; and had a beer...to calm my nerves.<br><br>Today, I can still hear sirens wailing, and fighter jets flying over head, the police still surround the White house and Cheney's place (which is 15min walk from my place).  Should be interesting for some time to come. <p>Mubbo Littlefury lvl 52 Halfling Rogue<br>T-8 levels and counting<br></p><i>Edited by: <A HREF=http://pub14.ezboard.com/ufaldaar.showPublicProfile?language=EN>Faldaar</A> at: 9/12/01 3:57:57 pm<br></i></td></tr><tr bgcolor=#aaaaaa><td nowrap width=20% valign=top align=left><span class=title> <A HREF=http://pub14.ezboard.com/usultar.showPublicProfile?language=EN>Sultar</A>&nbsp; <IMG HEIGHT=10 WIDTH=10 SRC="http://www.sacanimalshelter.org/images/s.gif" BORDER=0></span><br> <span class=usertitle>DF Guest</span><br> <font color=#000000>(9/12/01 4:00:56 pm)</font><br>   <a href=http://pub14.ezboard.com/fdeusfactumgeneral.showAddReplyScreenFromWeb?topicID=403.topic&index=10>Reply</a>   <BR><img src=http://www.fiu.edu/~rgonza04/pic2.jpg width=200 height=128></td><td valign=top align=left class=m><span class=title> Re: Hope your all safe</span><hr size=1> I hope you guys are all ok.  The past day and a half has been crazy, and all you can do is hope that all your friends and family are ok, and that no one you know was unfortunate enough to be there yesterday. <p><p><img src="http://www.noble-blade.net/images/ezboard/sig-small.gif" align="left">Sultar McWeiser<br>Warlord of The Rathe<br><a href="http://www.noble-blade.net">Noble Blade</a></p><i></i></td></tr><tr bgcolor=#999999><td nowrap width=20% valign=top align=left><span class=title> <A HREF=http://pub14.ezboard.com/uminosa.showPublicProfile?language=EN>Minosa</A></span><br> <span class=usertitle>Hugging Cleric</span><br> <font color=#000000>(9/13/01 9:46:42 am)</font><br>   <a href=http://pub14.ezboard.com/fdeusfactumgeneral.showAddReplyScreenFromWeb?topicID=403.topic&index=11>Reply</a>   </td><td valign=top align=left class=m><span class=title> Re: Hope your all safe</span><hr size=1> I have found myself totally unable to log on anywhere and &quot;play&quot;, either EQ or AO.  We find ourselves unable to concentrate, our thoughts consumed with what has happened and the sheer magnitude of hate directed at our country.<br><br>What is really weighing heavily is that last plane and how they knew they were the 4th flying bomb.  Those guys, all your ages, chose to fight and die before allowing themselves to reach their destination.  It could have been any of you .. any of us there, making that same choice.<br><br>We are changed.  <br><br>Love to all of you.<br>Mino<br><br><br><br>   <p></p><i></i></td></tr><tr bgcolor=#aaaaaa><td nowrap width=20% valign=top align=left><span class=title> <A HREF=http://pub14.ezboard.com/usanenu.showPublicProfile?language=EN>Sanenu</A>&nbsp; <IMG HEIGHT=10 WIDTH=10 SRC="http://www.ezboard.com/ezgfx/globalBlack.gif" BORDER=0></span><br> <span class=usertitle>Deus Factum</span><br> <font color=#000000>(9/13/01 12:18:48 pm)</font><br>   <a href=http://pub14.ezboard.com/fdeusfactumgeneral.showAddReplyScreenFromWeb?topicID=403.topic&index=12>Reply</a>   </td><td valign=top align=left class=m><span class=title> Re: Hope your all safe</span><hr size=1> I find myself thinking about that fourth plane often the last two days too Mino.  I would hope I would have it in me to have the strength to make the same decision they did if I were in that situation.  The one phone call from the man saying good bye to his wife and 3 month old baby is really heart wretching. <p></p><i></i></td></tr></table> </td></tr></table> <table border=0 width=95